# Applied automatically by MSBuild / dotnet build (not by Visual Studio IDE builds).
#
# Do not enable -mt (multithreaded MSBuild) here: the WebAssembly SDK's
# JsonToItemsTaskFactory / ReadWasmProps task fails under -mt on Linux CI
# ("does not support out of process TaskHost execution"). Pass -mt explicitly
# for non-WASM local builds if desired (e.g. Design.Tests).
